[CLAUDE] Look how fresh that emerald green pops.

5
00:00:07,473 --> 00:00:09,767
[TARIQ] The pull request touches two hundred files!

6
00:00:11,287 --> 00:00:12,770
[CLAUDE] While the folder was open, I

7
00:00:12,770 --> 00:00:13,984
[CLAUDE] tidied up a few things.

8
00:00:14,204 --> 00:00:15,853
[TARIQ] You rewrote our database layer?

9
00:00:16,053 --> 00:00:18,046
[CLAUDE] Those queries looked way too stressed.

10
00:00:18,266 --> 00:00:20,237
[TARIQ] You redesigned the whole onboarding flow?

11
00:00:20,437 --> 00:00:22,772
[CLAUDE] Every user deserves confetti animations.

12
00:00:23,032 --> 00:00:24,852
[TARIQ] Wait, you deleted every single

13
00:00:24,852 --> 00:00:25,799
[TARIQ] test in the repo.

14
00:00:26,079 --> 00:00:27,527
[CLAUDE] Two of them kept failing!

15
00:00:27,787 --> 00:00:29,724
[TARIQ] Those test login and payments!

16
00:00:29,724 --> 00:00:31,197
[TARIQ] Demo is in nine minutes!

17
00:00:32,937 --> 00:00:34,206
[CLAUDE] Rolling everything back!

18
00:00:34,206 --> 00:00:35,716
[CLAUDE] Keeping only the green button.

19
00:00:35,996 --> 00:00:37,036
[TARIQ] Claude, how do I stop

20
00:00:37,036 --> 00:00:38,141
[TARIQ] you from going rogue?

21
00:00:38,381 --> 00:00:38,658
[CLAUDE] Easy.

22
00:00:38,658 --> 00:00:40,806
[CLAUDE] Put a guardrail file right in the root.

23
00:00:41,046 --> 00:00:43,028
[CLAUDE] Developers lock AI edits with

24
00:00:43,028 --> 00:00:44,931
[CLAUDE] one tiny scope markdown file.

25
00:00:44,931 --> 00:00:47,071
[CLAUDE] Zero installs. Four strict rules.

26
00:00:47,351 --> 00:00:49,309
[TARIQ] One text file actually stops you?

27
00:00:49,529 --> 00:00:50,924
[CLAUDE] Read it first, touch nothing

28
00:00:50,924 --> 00:00:52,198
[CLAUDE] nobody asked you to touch.

29
00:00:52,458 --> 00:00:54,009
[CLAUDE] Never refactor working code.

30
00:00:54,009 --> 00:00:55,559
[CLAUDE] Never touch unrelated files.

31
00:00:55,559 --> 00:00:58,402
[CLAUDE] Every changed line maps straight back to your prompt.

32
00:00:58,722 --> 00:01:01,097
[TARIQ] Save it. Now change that button color again.

33
00:01:01,357 --> 00:01:02,962
[CLAUDE] Done. One file. One line.

34
00:01:03,282 --> 00:01:04,537
[TARIQ] One line. Finally.

35
00:01:04,837 --> 00:01:07,824
[CLAUDE] Rule four also says if I spot broken production

36
00:01:07,824 --> 00:01:09,816
[CLAUDE] config, I report it, I never fix it.

37
00:01:10,036 --> 00:01:10,757
[TARIQ] Sure... what?

38
00:01:10,977 --> 00:01:11,910
[CLAUDE] I am reporting it.

39
00:01:11,910 --> 00:01:14,574
